  "description": "The temple of the god Nab\u00fb, Eurunanam (\u201cHouse, the Very City\u201d), was located in the New City district of Babylon, in the eastern half of the inner city. According to the Babylonian topographical text Tintir = Babylon Tablet IV, it was the only dais in that part of Babylon.",
